    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on updating our internal guidelines for the company. We've had a bit of tension lately with people bringing up political stuff in Slack and during meetings. Can you write me a policy memo that balances the need for a cohesive, inclusive workplace with the employees' rights to individual political expression?",
